{"type":"verify_ran","timestamp":"2026-09-20T19:37:09.631Z","data":{"command":"node --import tsx --test tests/harness-catalog.test.ts tests/config-planner-catalog.test.ts tests/harness.test.ts tests/config-planner.test.ts","exitCode":0,"duration":0.28,"output":"▶ catalog-driven planner validation\n  ✔ accepts every catalogued harness with any supported casing and normalizes the name (1.239086ms)\n  ✔ retains the required non-empty planner model (0.252657ms)\n  ✔ rejects uncatalogued harnesses naming the catalog entries (0.119269ms)\n  ✔ rejects optional settings unsupported by the selected harness, naming harness and setting (0.250647ms)\n  ✔ rejects malformed optional settings before harness-specific checks (0.174718ms)\n✔ catalog-driven planner validation (2.980877ms)\n▶ catalog-driven planner selection\n  ✔ uses explicit planner values and the supported default agent (0.348286ms)\n  ✔ never leaks executor effort or cross-harness defaults into an explicit planner (0.190797ms)\n  ✔ falls back to the selected executor catalog entry with native attribution (0.273647ms)\n  ✔ uses planner values for a mixed harness selection without executor leakage (0.139679ms)\n✔ catalog-driven planner selection (1.221886ms)\n▶ planner configuration integration and exports\n  ✔ keeps defineConfig planner validation wired to the catalog (0.236787ms)\n  ✔ exposes catalog planner helpers through the public entry point (0.116529ms)\n✔ planner configuration integration and exports (0.491945ms)\n▶ planner configuration and manifest attribution\n  ✔ defineConfig accepts valid planner configurations (5.379481ms)\n  ✔ defineConfig rejects invalid planner configurations (1.320416ms)\n  ✔ loadConfig loads planner block from config file (104.226761ms)\n  ✔ buildManifest populates manifest.planner from config (23.813526ms)\n✔ planner configuration and manifest attribution (135.632082ms)\n▶ harness capability catalog\n  ✔ contains every supported harness exactly once in ordered available names (0.89412ms)\n  ✔ normalizes lookup across supported casing and reports catalog names when unknown (0.388535ms)\n  ✔ resolves each harness executable through catalog metadata (0.307857ms)\n  ✔ derives executor identity only from the selected harness, with a default sentinel (0.307697ms)\n  ✔ declares planner-agent capability and native attribution per catalog entry (0.111099ms)\n  ✔ keeps adapter factories at runtime parity with catalog names (0.261227ms)\n  ✔ exposes the catalog through the public configuration entry point (0.123119ms)\n✔ harness capability catalog (3.173545ms)\n▶ Harness Adapter and Event Logging\n  ✔ appendHarnessEvent appends valid JSONL events to .run/events/<n>.jsonl (19.515533ms)\n  ✔ MockAdapter setup and spawn simulates task execution and emits events (14.24421ms)\n  ✔ AgyAdapter initializes with correct name and can perform setup (13.984545ms)\n  ✔ getHarnessAdapter resolves registered adapters and rejects unknown names (11.77059ms)\n  ✔ AgyAdapter includes --print-timeout <n>s in args based on config timeouts (12.140115ms)\n✔ Harness Adapter and Event Logging (72.694272ms)\nℹ tests 27\nℹ suites 6\nℹ pass 27\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 253.149307\n"}}
